@ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5022
@authToken = eyJhbGciOi...

### 1. Register User
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice Smith",
  "email": "alice.smith@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Login User
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.smith@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Change Password (Authenticated)
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword456!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewSecurePassword456!"
}

### 4. Forgot Password (Request short-lived reset token)
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.smith@example.com"
}

### 5. Reset Password (Using single-use token received via email)
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.smith@example.com",
  "token": "RAW_RESET_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL",
  "newPassword": "NewResetPassword789!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewResetPassword789!"
}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Me)
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Update Current User Profile (Me)
PUT {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice Johnson",
  "email": "alice.johnson@example.com"
}

### 8. Get User by ID (Self or Admin)
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. List All Users (Admin only)
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Update User Role (Admin only)
PATCH {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Agent"
}

### 11. Search, Filter, Sort, and Paginate Tickets
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Tickets?search=database&status=Open&priority=High&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Assigned Tickets (Agent / Admin)
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Tickets/assigned?status=InProgress&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

