GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/

### 30. AI - Classify Proposed Ticket Content
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/AI/classify-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection failure after Wi-Fi roaming",
  "description": "Whenever I switch between office Wi-Fi access points, the corporate VPN tunnel drops and reports certificate handshake failure."
}

