### 34. Knowledge Base - Search / List Articles
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/KnowledgeBase?search=vpn&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 35. Knowledge Base - Get Article by ID
GET {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/KnowledgeBase/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 36. Knowledge Base - Create Article (Agent / Admin)
POST {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/KnowledgeBase
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Resolving VPN Handshake Drops during Wi-Fi Roaming",
  "content": "Step 1: Check driver version. Step 2: Clear local IPsec certificate cache using certutil. Step 3: Re-authenticate through MFA portal.",
  "category": "Network",
  "tags": "vpn,network,wifi,certificate",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 37. Knowledge Base - Delete Article (Admin only)
DELETE {{ResolveIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/KnowledgeBase/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

